      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This needs to be the game. Honestly, I am open to my friends joining me in my home or my core friends (shoot whatever that new friend group feature is called in the beta). Lately I am trying to get folks that can become gamers to join vrchat. These are seniors or people who just play here and there and would have loved being outside in real life. Because of the ongoing public Health restrictions, these people are now kind of feeling progressively lonely and so I really want to support their mental health. I know about 5-6 people who are willing to try a game that could be easy for them to adapt but this game has a little flaw in how you initially try to meet up with friends (well it’s more like it’s hard to explain this to the new players and get buy in)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
