      "value": "@{5f2d8365b923f7086baf9410|full_name}: ahh I start in steam vr is why, rather than log in via a browser to launch an instance and share a link. Seniors are really tricky to teach though, it is hard to show them ‘here’s 3 ways to find me in the game, then after we meet up, we’re going to travel to other worlds in 2 other ways potentially.’ It would just be easier to have a group home then portal the group.",
